  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CAR_Improving the National Procurement System</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This IDF aims to improve the efficiency, economy and transparency of the Central African Republic (CAR) Government&apos;s procurement, by developing operational capacities in procurement, particularly through supporting the implementation of e-procurement in targeted agencies of the CAR government.  The proposed IDF aims to, in the context of the work of the wider donor community, support CAR in reaching the base-line procurement indicators (OECD/DAC/WB), as well as the performance indicators to improve the national Procurement System, as agreed in the Paris Declaration.  Grant:  $500,000 Original Closing Date Aug. 31, 2012 This IDF aims to improve the efficiency and transparency of the Central African Republic (CAR) Government&apos;s procurement, by developing operational capacities in procurement in targeted agencies of the CAR government.</narrative>
  </description>
